[8:35p.m.] #Ejigbo #Jakande #TrafficUpdate

Traffic is slow from Pako through Oke Afa to Jakande Gate.

Ijegun road to Jakande gate toward Pako is also good.

Traffic is good from NNPC intersection down to Ikotun Roundabout to Old garage. Ikotun to Oju Odo is ok as well.

Synagogue up to NNPC intersection, Mubostic to Canoe, likewise return trip from Canoe to Mubostic is good.

